    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_00",
      "hash64": "8A4BA42B26466447",
      "text": "I’m so sorry, everyone...[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "8E0B5A368673287A",
      "text": "About a year and a half ago...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_01",
      "hash64": "8A4BA32B26466294",
      "text": "I’m so sorry... I think I went a little too far...[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_akuboss_01",
      "hash64": "A36B9964C593B189",
      "text": "Nah, don’t worry ’bout it.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_akuboss_02",
      "hash64": "A36B9664C593AC70",
      "text": "We’re the ones who asked you to put us through\\nsome tough battle practice so we can train up.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_02",
      "hash64": "8A4BA62B264667AD",
      "text": "Yeah, but...[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_dokuboss_01",
      "hash64": "C6B00BA0BF825A19",
      "text": "Truly, you need not apologize, my lady.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_dokuboss_02",
      "hash64": "C6B008A0BF825500",
      "text": "Thanks to thy sage instruction, I am making\\nswift strides toward mastering the art of battle![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_fairyboss_01",
      "hash64": "15A231192EB8F00F",
      "text": "And I could never have evolved my Pokémon\\nwithout you, Eri![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_honooboss_01",
      "hash64": "33700B5D07EC0C89",
      "text": "Even the big boss said it’s thanks to you that we\\nhave a fightin’ chance against our bullies![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_akuboss_03",
      "hash64": "A36B9764C593AE23",
      "text": "See? Nothin’ but gratitude. To us, you’re the\\nbrightest star in the whole team![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_03",
      "hash64": "8A4BA52B264665FA",
      "text": "Hehe. Come on, quit being silly![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_fairyboss_02",
      "hash64": "15A232192EB8F1C2",
      "text": "Um, just one thing...\\c\\nWe’ve been training for four whole hours now.\\nI’m totally pooped.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_04",
      "hash64": "8A4BA02B26465D7B",
      "text": "Ah, I’m sorry! You all really should take a break.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_05",
      "hash64": "8A4B9F2B26465BC8",
      "text": "I’ll go for a run while you rest up![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_dokuboss_03",
      "hash64": "C6B009A0BF8256B3",
      "text": "My lady...we four have each trained in our turn—\\nbut you, our steadfast mentor, have rested not\\r\\nonce. I cannot help but worry for thy health.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_06",
      "hash64": "8A4BA22B264660E1",
      "text": "Thank you for your concern, Atticus.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_07",
      "hash64": "8A4BA12B26465F2E",
      "text": "But lately...I feel like I can take anything.\\nEven if I’m really tired or feel like crying.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_08",
      "hash64": "8A4B9C2B264656AF",
      "text": "Remember that time we all got together and\\nriffed on the Gym Badge designs to create our\\r\\nvery own Star Badges?[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_21",
      "hash64": "8A45172B26410902",
      "text": "Well, I don’t know what it is, but just looking at\\nmy Star Badge makes me feel so strong...\\c\\nLike I want to give it my all![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_09",
      "hash64": "8A4B9B2B264654FC",
      "text": "I gave my all, but it wasn’t enough—\\nI wasn’t enough...[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_10",
      "hash64": "8A481E2B26434ABE",
      "text": "You showed amazing strength.\\c\\nEven if the code didn’t require me to give it to\\nyou, I’d want you to have this.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_waza_01",
      "hash64": "12E1133143212C92",
      "text": "I’d like to see you try out my trademark move,\\ntoo! Here—this one’s for you.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_11",
      "hash64": "8A481F2B26434C71",
      "text": "... ... ...\\n... ... ...[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_12",
      "hash64": "8A481C2B26434758",
      "text": "I know you’re part of Operation Starfall...[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_13",
      "hash64": "8A481D2B2643490B",
      "text": "But I could tell from our battle that you’re not a\\nbad person.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_14",
      "hash64": "8A48222B2643518A",
      "text": "The way your Pokémon look[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0001)]s at you with such\\ntrust gives it away.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_15",
      "hash64": "8A48232B2643533D",
      "text": "Do me a favor and look away for a moment?\\nThis is a bit much for me to take...[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_16",
      "hash64": "8A48202B26434E24",
      "text": "I just r-really...[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_17",
      "hash64": "8A48212B26434FD7",
      "text": "RAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!!![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_01",
      "hash64": "5C186440FEE613BA",
      "text": "Looks like it’s all over.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
