    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_03",
      "hash64": "E7EEF1AC2C216F2B",
      "text": "So, what did you want to ask me?[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "5C185D40FEE607D5",
      "text": "You seem to be on much friendlier terms with Eri\\ncompared to the other grunts.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "5C185C40FEE60622",
      "text": "Why is that?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_04",
      "hash64": "E7EEF6AC2C2177AA",
      "text": "Oh, you spotted that?\\c\\nWell, all right... I don’t mind telling you.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_05",
      "hash64": "E7EEF7AC2C21795D",
      "text": "Truth is, I used to hate Riri.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "5C14DF40FEE2FBE4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_06",
      "hash64": "E7EEF4AC2C217444",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_07",
      "hash64": "E7EEF5AC2C2175F7",
      "text": "She’s an amazing Trainer and athlete—and she’s\\nreally pretty, too.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "E7EEEAAC2C216346",
      "text": "It took her no time at all to become popular at\\nthe academy.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_09",
      "hash64": "E7EEEBAC2C2164F9",
      "text": "I was queen of the class before she came along,\\nbut then everyone liked her more than me...[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "5C14E040FEE2FD97",
      "text": "So let me guess...you started to pick on her?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_10",
      "hash64": "E7F278AC2C248A67",
      "text": "Pretty much. I got our classmates to join in, too...\\nWe were all so stupid.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_11",
      "hash64": "E7F277AC2C2488B4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "5C14E140FEE2FF4A",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_12",
      "hash64": "E7F27AAC2C248DCD",
      "text": "But in the end, kids are always fickle—and once\\none thrill wears off, they look for something new.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_13",
      "hash64": "E7F279AC2C248C1A",
      "text": "Before long, the class chose me as their next\\ntarget and started bullying me instead.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "5C14E240FEE300FD",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_14",
      "hash64": "E7F274AC2C24839B",
      "text": "I guess I deserved it. But then Riri...she chose to\\nhelp me even though I’d been so horrible to her.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_15",
      "hash64": "E7F273AC2C2481E8",
      "text": "She told me that she understood how hard it is\\nto have no one on your side...\\c\\nAnd she invited me into Team Star.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "5C14DB40FEE2F518",
      "text": "Even after you bullied her like that... What a\\nkind girl.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_16",
      "hash64": "E7F276AC2C248701",
      "text": "She really is. And joining the team has worked\\nout great for us. It’s been so much fun![VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_15",
      "hash64": "5C14DC40FEE2F6CB",
      "text": "Fun? There are rumors that Team Star likewise\\nengages in bullying...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_17",
      "hash64": "E7F275AC2C24854E",
      "text": "After hearing my story, do you really think\\nthat’s true?[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_16",
      "hash64": "5C14DD40FEE2F87E",
      "text": "Ah, no... I merely...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_18",
      "hash64": "E7F270AC2C247CCF",
      "text": "Riri and the rest of Team Star made me who I\\nam today.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_19",
      "hash64": "E7F26FAC2C247B1C",
      "text": "Please...don’t take away our greatest treasure.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
